model time08_before
  tally 2
  on 2025-05-31
  start 2025-05-01
  end 2025-05-31
  note "Probe TIME-08: two rules on one day put in a written order with `before` (L §5.14.2, a written order outside a cycle). Both are decisions that read konto; the sweep changes konto, the parents' top-up doesn't, so without an order the top-up would act after the sweep. `before sweep` puts it ahead, so it reads konto's balance before the sweep. The order names a decision, never a plan or an observation (GD-11). A minimal text of session 5's list (TC-5): no card and no key."

source probe_text "Probe TIME-08 (session 5's text list, TC-5): a made-up story and rules, with no card and no key"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

place employer: outside lives 2025-05-01..

place konto: accounts DUK lives 2025-05-01..

place parents: outside lives 2025-05-01..

place savings: accounts DUK lives 2025-05-01..

input keep_floor: money DUK

input pay_amt: money DUK

input pay_day: date

input rule_day: date

input top_up_rate: num

move sweep: transfers
  on rule_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to savings amount max(0, bal(konto) - keep_floor)
  note "rule 1: keep a floor in konto and move the rest to savings; a decision, so it runs after the day's plans (L §5.14.2)"

move top_up: transfers
  on rule_day
  reads konto
  before sweep
  leg cash from parents to savings amount round(bal(konto) * top_up_rate, minor(DUK), half-up)
  note "rule 2: the parents add a part of what konto holds to savings, looking at konto before the sweep (`before sweep`, L §5.14.2: a decision put ahead of another decision it would otherwise follow)"

move wage: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from employer to konto amount pay_amt
  note "story: the pay lands on the rules' day; a plan, so it is booked before both decisions"

ask q_before: flows(top_up, 2025-05-15), flows(sweep, 2025-05-15) law 2025-05-31

version story
  cite probe_text
  governs always
  known 2025-05-01
  note "Stipulations, known from the model's start (L §4.5)."
  keep_floor = 2000.00 "rule 1: the floor kept in konto"
  opening[konto] = 1500.00 at 2025-05-01 start "story: konto's balance before anything happens in May 2025"
  pay_amt = 6000.00 "story: the pay"
  pay_day = 2025-05-15 "story: the pay lands on 15 May 2025"
  rule_day = 2025-05-15 "story: both rules run on 15 May 2025"
  top_up_rate = 10 % "rule 2: the parents add 10 % of konto's balance"
